RXPGuides.RegisterGuide([[
#retail
#group RestedXP Midnight
#name |cRXP_WARN_Before You Pick a Guide|r
step
+|cRXP_PICK_Default:|r This guide will do the campaign, delves and some side quests (identical to Campaign & Sidequests). It will skip side quests if you're overleveled. This is the fastest route if you don't want to use Warmode and are not crafting at the end.
step
+|cRXP_PICK_Campaign & Sidequests:|r This guide will do the campaign, delves and some side quests. It will skip side quests if you're overleveled. This is the fastest route if you don't want to use Warmode and are not crafting at the end.
step
+|cRXP_PICK_Campaign & Delves:|r This guide will do the campaign and all delves. It has no built in xp skips and expects you to craft at the end.
step
+|cRXP_PICK_Alt Leveling:|r This guide is for your alts after you have done the campaign once. You can do the chapters in any order and stop early if you want to craft for the last level.
step
+|cRXP_PICK_Sojourner:|r This guide is designed for completing all storylines efficiently in one go.
step
+|cRXP_PICK_Sojourner & Campaign:|r This guide is designed to complete all storylines and the campaign efficiently in one go.
step
+|cRXP_PICK_(80-87) Level-Up Campaigns:|r Allows progression through the campaign only.
step
+|cRXP_PICK_Delves:|r Allows you to pick individual delves or choose the Delves World Tour for a route through all delves and their quests.
step
+|cRXP_PICK_Storylines:|r This guide lets you select individual storylines required for the Sojourner achievement and more.
step
+If you want to use the multibox functionality, select any 80-90 route. Then open RestedXP Options under Guide Routing enable "Multibox Mode".
]])
RXPGuides.RegisterGuide([[
#retail
#version 20
#group RestedXP Midnight
#subgroup Pre-Turnins
#name a) Pre-Turnins Booklet
#internal
step
+Stormwind Quests can be turned in at the start: under "Guide: Prepturnins" or "Miscellaneous Turnins"
*Expect heavy crowding in the Midnight intro at launch. Turning in some Pre-Quests before may reduce lag/DCs.
*In Retail, being far enough behind the pack is often manageable or even advantageous.
step
+Global Quests can be turned in from everywhere(some pet battles for example) ideally those are turned in an area with an XP Buff
*The guide will guide you to Ohn'ahran Plains for 5% extra XP when it's time to turn them in.
*If you want to do them at the start select "First Crafts & Global Turnins" keep in mind you will need to return to this guide if you want to do first crafts later.
step
+Should you ever be stuck in any prep guide and you do not want to waste any time manually skips the steps or select the chapter after turnins.
step
+We only cover Kun'lai Turnins, netherstorm is not supported
]])
