#sticky
*|cRXP_WARN_Chapter 5:|r Item Showcase
*Highlights useful items for leveling, allowing you to choose which ones to pursue.
step
+|T4549102:0|t[Crystallized Augment Rune] increases your Main stat.
step !Shaman/!Mage/!Hunter/!Evoker
+|T4559223:0|t[Thunderous Drums] increases Haste by 15% for you and your party(shares cd with other bloodlust effects)
step
+|T1385244:0|t[Invigorating Healing Potion] is a healing potion.
step
+|T134014:0|t[Shadowberries] can regenerate up to 10% max health every 5 seconds.
.mob Mother Om'ra
step
+|T4497566:0|t[Potion of Gusts] will propel you forward a short distance.
step
+|T1405809:0|t[Gunshoes] significantly boost your Movement speed and allow you to travel on water for a short period of time.
step
+|T133632:0|t[Goblin Glider Kit] propel you forward and allow you to slowfall for 2 minutes or when you hit the ground.
step
+|T1405811:0|t[Leystone Buoy] will propel you to the ocean's surface.
step
+|T1373906:0|t[Felslate Anchor] will pull you straight to the ocean floor.
step
+|T463898:0|t[Potion of Deepholm] teleports to Deepholm.
step
+|T3671893:0|t[Fried Bonefish] movement speed boost when killing an enemy.
step
+|T628559:0|t[Cracked Radinax Control Gem] a big movement speed boosts with 3 charges.
step
+|T4672181:0|t[Pep-In-Your-Step] boosts movement speed.
step
+|T237296:0|t[Gnomish Army Knife] for profession tasks.
step
+|T134042:0|t[Unagi Skewer] deals damage to attackers(very minimal gain).
step
+|T986491:0|t[Loot-A-Rang]|cFFFF0000is an extremely useful during questing as it allows you to loot mobs from a far away range|r.
step
+The |T461816:0|t[Banner of Cooperation], |T461817:0|t[Standard of Unity], and |T461818:0|t[Battle Standard of Coordination] provide a significant XP boost, increasing the XP gained from monsters by up to 15% as long as you stay within 100 yards of the banner.
step
+|T1444943:0|t[Legion Dalaran Hearthstone] teleports you to Legion Dalaran.
step
+|T461813:0|t[Shroud of Cooperation], |T461814:0|t[Wrap of Unity] and |T461812:0|t[Cloak of Coordination] teleports you to Stormwind or Orgrimmar.
]])
