RXPGuides.RegisterGuide([[
#retail
#version 1
#group RestedXP Midnight
#subgroup Lairs
#subweight 993.98
#name L) Tidebound Grotto Lair (A)
#displayname Tidebound Grotto Lair (Season 2)
#chapter
step
#title Tidebound Grotto Entrance
.goto 2512,59.90,66.30
+Swim down to the |cRXP_WARN_Tidebound Grotto|r entrance and select a difficulty.
*|cRXP_WARN_World:|r Automatically groups players. |cRXP_WARN_Normal/Heroic/Mythic:|r Form a premade group first.
*This guide automatically switches to the boss notes when you enter the Lair, then returns to your previous RestedXP guide when you leave.
step
#title Nymrissa Wavecaller - Quick Notes
+|cRXP_WARN_ADDS / ALLURING BUBBLE:|r Kill |cRXP_ENEMY_Bubblefin Shorerunners|r before they reach the bubble. Murlocs that reach it become Berserkers and pulse raid-wide damage.
+|cRXP_WARN_SWIRLING WHIRLPOOLS:|r Find the gap with no whirlpool and move into the safe lane. The whirlpools converge on the center, then the bubble pops and knocks the raid back.
+|cRXP_WARN_CHILLING FROST:|r If targeted, move slowly and keep your Frost Orb drops grouped together instead of scattering them around the arena.
+|cRXP_WARN_HEROIC+:|r Soak Frost Orbs before they Shatter, but avoid taking too many Orb stacks at once.
+|cRXP_WARN_TANKS:|r Face dangerous tank attacks away from the raid. On Mythic, use |cRXP_WARN_Water Jet|r to wash away |cRXP_WARN_Lingering Frost|r patches.
+|cRXP_WARN_HEALERS:|r Prepare raid healing for |cRXP_WARN_Abyssal Rain|r and the bubble |cRXP_WARN_Pop!|r.
+|cRXP_WARN_MYTHIC:|r Kill |cRXP_ENEMY_Bubblefin Frostscales|r quickly; their Waterfog Shield heavily protects nearby murlocs. Soaked Frost Orbs also trigger raid-wide Frost Burst.
+|cRXP_WARN_TIP:|r Bloodlust/Heroism on pull. Nymrissa repeats the same mechanic cycle until defeated.
]])
